---
import InnerLayout from "../../layouts/InnerLayout.astro";
import LinkBox from "../../components/ITserviceLinkBox.astro";
---

<InnerLayout>
  <section class="it-services-all">
    <div class="container">
      <LinkBox />
      <div class="text-container">
        <h3>HARDWARE/SOFTWARE MAINTENANCE</h3>
        <h4>Cover Your Assets with Single-Source Service</h4>
        <p>
          Computer downtime is expensive. Every minute of downtime means losses
          in productivity and income. We make it easy to coordinate service
          coverage for single or multiple locations. Our National Service
          Network provides consistent maintenance and repair anywhere in the
          country. Regardless of the hardware problem or location, you make only
          one phone call to our Central Dispatch Center. We act fast to keep
          your system up and running – and your downtime down.
        </p>
        <p>
          BIM’s Hardware Maintenance Services offer you qualified technical
          expertise, flexible coverage, and responsive nationwide service. It’s
          one of the smartest, most cost-effective investments that you can make
          for your company.
        </p>
        <h4>Service Options to Meet Your Needs</h4>
        <p>
          Select the coverage you want. Our flexible programs let you pick and
          choose to design the coverage that you that you need. Select from the
          following:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Maintenance Agreement – Reduces downtime by providing all the parts
            and labor needed to restore malfunctioning new or used equipment to
            proper operating condition. A maintenance agreement puts a ceiling
            on your maintenance costs and guarantees response times.
          </li>
          <li>
            Warranty Upgrade Program – An easy way to upgrade manufacturer
            warranties to meet your service needs by improving response levels.
          </li>
          <li>
            Time and Materials Program – You pay only for the specific services
            performed by our qualified technicians, systems engineers and
            consultants.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          <a href="/contact">CONTACT US</a>TODAY TO DISCUSS HARDWARE/SOFTWARE MAINTENANCE?
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="img-container">
        <img src="/images/icons/technology.jpg" alt="" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</InnerLayout>
